@startuml

salt
{
  <b>ORE STUDIO - SYSTEM ADMINISTRATION: OPERATIONS</b>
  --
  Housekeeping / <b>Market data delivery counts</b>          [ Back to the stores ]
  --
  <b>[ Details ]</b>    Bound
  --
  {
    <b>Market data delivery counts</b>   Bounded
    A store of the installation - marketdata.delivery_counts
    --
    <b>THE STORE</b>
    {#
      Code | marketdata.delivery_counts | Owner | marketdata
      Target kind | Table | Measured by | rows
      Target | ores_marketdata_delivery_counts_tbl | Time column | period_start
    }
    How many items each feed delivered for each series in each period, carried forward.
  }
  --
  <b>SIZE</b>     How large the store is, and how it moved over the horizon the read covered.
  Size now 17.0 MiB        Contents 28,799 rows        Measured 28 Nov 2026, 09:15
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                     [ Last day ]   [ Last week ]   [ Last month ]
  .
  17.0 MiB  !                                 *     *     *     *     *     *
            !                    *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *
   8.5 MiB  !  *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *
            !  *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *
       0 B  !  *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *     *
              11-21 00:00      11-23 16:00      11-26 08:00      11-28 00:00
  .
  Each mark is one measurement, oldest first. The time axis states the window the
  read covered, in UTC, and the value axis the size.
  --
  2.1 MiB to 17.0 MiB over 7.0 days - 14.9 MiB a week, rising
  --
  <b>THE BOUND</b>  the page's second tab
  Bounded: a scheduled sweep deletes the rows past the period, on the policy's own
  cadence.  Policy delivery_counts_30d - 30 days - every 24 h - applied 3 Dec.
}

@enduml
